Z||000003||BBBAD GT||06-11-2001||06:06 PM||||I bet you are asking if the std transmission on a V8 is too much gear, and no, its not that bad.  But, going down the highway at 2,200-2,300 rpms at 65 mph does suck the gas better than if you were traveling 1,900-2,000 rpms, where I would of put it if the Fiero ever came with a V8 as standard equipment.  Still getting 20 mpg tho with that gearing, so its not bad.<P>  <P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero/V8sig.jpg">        <P><A HREF="http://home.att.net/~nomercy5.0/V8Specs.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8 For Sale</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
